cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below. The git history records individual software contributions."
title: "A Multi-Source Machine Learning Framework for Satellite-Fused PM2.5 Estimation and Five-Day Atmospheric Forecasting over Urban India"
abstract: >-
  A reproducibility-first research platform for daily PM2.5 estimation over
  Faridabad, Delhi-NCR, combining CPCB ground observations (2016-2024),
  INSAT-3D Level-2G aerosol optical depth and MERRA-2 reanalysis. The
  repository reports two separately evaluated tracks: historical ground-only
  prediction, and whether satellite and meteorological inputs add measurable
  value. Every published number is traced to a persisted artefact.
